{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-175985","runs":[{"text":"→ Four contenders all claim to be the next ruler of the Vampires and it is your choice to choose who it will be ("},{"text":"/join eternalnight","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/eternal-night"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176119","runs":[{"text":"→ Necromancers use Akriloth's body as a host for Sepulchure's soul ("},{"text":"/join shadowspire","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadowspire"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176207","runs":[{"text":"→ Deadmoor, help Cysero return the screams of Mallora, a young girl who was murdered over a century ago ("},{"text":"/join deadmoor","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/deadmoor"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176329","runs":[{"text":"→ The Living Dungeon, fight through the Titan Hollow to battle Drayko the Dracomancer! And then do it again! And again! And again... ("},{"text":"/join livingdungeon","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/tree-titan"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176485","runs":[{"text":"→ Cysero's Secrets, stop the Queen of Monsters from taking Cysero's goose ("},{"text":"/join goose","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/cysero-s-secret"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176574","runs":[{"text":"→ Travel into the past to help an assassin with a dark secret steal the Star Core before the Queen of Monsters can get it ("},{"text":"/join starsinc","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/starsinc-fortress"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176714","runs":[{"text":"→ Dage the Evil wages war on those in the Mirror Realm, bringing chaos to both worlds ("},{"text":"/join brightfortress","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/bright-fortress-location"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176824","runs":[{"text":"→ Journey to the Surface of the Sun, help Cysero and Warlic discover what is draining the sun's energy ("},{"text":"/join thirdspell","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/third-spell"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-176947","runs":[{"text":"→ New Year's 2016, stop the Queen of Monsters' invasion of the town of Northpointe ("},{"text":"/join grimattack","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/grim-attack"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177050","runs":[{"text":"→ Battle alongside Abel in the Ice Plane, helping him discover his powers, identity and destiny ("},{"text":"/join iceplane","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ice-plane"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177164","runs":[{"text":"→ Dreadrock Citadel, a new Evil hub for the original Queen of Monsters saga ("},{"text":"/join dreadrock","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dreadrock-citadel"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177259","runs":[{"text":"→ Skytower Aegis, the new Good hub for the original Queen of Monsters saga ("},{"text":"/join skytower","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/skytower-aegis"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177352","runs":[{"text":"→ The Vampire Pirates are at war with the Lycan Pirates over the richest prize in the seven seas - the Midnight Sea Crown! It is your choice who will become the Midnight Pirate King (or Queen) ("},{"text":"/join midnightcrown","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/midnight-crown"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177568","runs":[{"text":"→ Help Voltaire decorate the sanctum of Drakath's Chaos Militia, Crownsreach ("},{"text":"/join crownsreachfxiii","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/crownsreach-fxiii"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177671","runs":[{"text":"→ Crownsreach Hub, where you can choose to ally with the fores of Chaos ("},{"text":"/join crownsreach","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/crownsreach"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177764","runs":[{"text":"→ Dreadfire Keep, an outpost that the Queen's allies, the Infernals, have taken camp ("},{"text":"/join dreadfire","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dreadfire-keep"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177869","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":":\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177893","runs":[{"text":"→ Deadmoor: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZfpB7c9c5qA"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177916","runs":[{"text":"→ The Living Dungeon: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0zNYiQpViTc"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177949","runs":[{"text":"→ Cysero's Secrets: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DYg2wW_RLwA"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-177980","runs":[{"text":"→ Starsinc Fortress: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ho2EgQQZlDc"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-178012","runs":[{"text":"→ Bright Fortress: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fXTvy9RV1os"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-178042","runs":[{"text":"→ Third Spell: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uJDkcTmqAIg"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Shogun of Shadows","url":"/cot-truyen/shogun-of-shadows"},"missingImageCount":1}